Alembic migrations for FranchiseGuard AI.

The database URL is taken from app settings (DATABASE_URL), not alembic.ini.

Common commands (run from backend/):

    alembic upgrade head              # apply all migrations
    alembic downgrade -1              # roll back one
    alembic revision --autogenerate -m "add X"   # diff models -> new migration
    alembic current                  # show applied revision
    alembic history --verbose

The initial migration (0001) is the full baseline schema. Regenerate from an
empty database with:  alembic upgrade head
